(7769, '손목보호구 임시 마법부여 - 최하급 지혜', 'Imprégnation de bracelets (Sagesse mineure) OLD', 'Imbue Bracers - Minor Wisdom OLD', 'Imbue Bracers - Minor Wisdom OLD', 'Imbue Bracers - Minor Wisdom OLD', 'Imbuir brazales: sabiduría menor OLD', '', '', '', '', '', '', '손목보호구에 일시적으로 마법을 부여해 60분 동안 착용자의 지능을 4만큼 증가시킵니다.', 'Imprègne des bracelets de sagesse (+ 4 en intelligence pour le porteur pendant 60 minutes).', 'Armschienen mit Weisheit erfüllen, die, die Intelligenz des Trägers 60 Minuten lang um 4 erhöht.', 'Imbue bracers with wisdom that increases the wearers intellect by 4 for 60 minutes.', 'Imbue bracers with wisdom that increases the wearers intellect by 4 for 60 minutes.', 'Imbuye los brazales con sabiduría que aumenta el intelecto de quien los lleva en 4 p. durante 60 minutos.', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
